      "statusChangeID": "5ee0125608ba0c26249caeb8",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "First, UdonBehaviour[] now sits alongside UdonBehaviour in the VRC category.\nI agree that the user may expect to see 'CustomEvent' in the 'Events' category, but the search is built from the underlying data, and the data has CustomEvent in the Special category, it would need special, brittle handling to move it to another spot. If anything, it would fit better in VRC > Events since that is where SDK events are kept. It's easily findable through search so I think it doesn't warrant special handling. I was able to combine VRC Events and Udon Events into a single category in Quick Search.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
