      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: I've read UdonRegistrySearchWindow.cs . I understand you don't want to touch underlying data registry. I thought `List<SearchTreeEntry> _registryCache` is just UI thing. so it would be modifiable around the end of `CreateSearchTree` method. though it might be dirty implementation.\nI think this is also candidate of alias solution that we discussed in case of Branch node. Anyway, I understand the decision for now.",
