  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-06-09T12:18:30.050Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "1. Categorize `CustomEvent` into `Events`\nCurrently it's in `Special`. That is understandable from implementation point of view because it's an internal function of UdonBehaviour. But for user, there isn't any reason why it isn't in Events. (I've heard a few times questions about where it is. )\n2. Categorize `Behavior[]` into `Behavior`\nCurrently it's in `Special`. Old Udon Graph categorize it into `Behavior`. Behavior is a category of using another UdonBehaviour. So it is suitable for `Behavior[]`\nVersion: VRCSDK-UDON-2020.06.04.14.15_Closed_Community_Test",
